msgid "测试与验收"
msgstr "Testing and acceptance"

msgid "执行入口"
msgstr "Entry points"

msgid "从主仓根目录执行；临时文件放在项目输出目录::"
msgstr "Run from the parent repository root; put temporary files in the project output directory::"

msgid ""
"test 为宿主/构建契约，test-long 包括长流程与恢复，test-legacy 显式运行 非生产 OS 测试，test-smoke 顺序检查三类介质的 BIOS/UEFI 启动。 "
"test-build 包含 Pages 文档回归，宿主需要 Sphinx；普通内核和用户态编译不因此依赖它。 按风险选择定向检查；通过已有失败之前的步骤不能称为全套通过。"
msgstr ""
"test covers host/build contracts; test-long includes long workflows and recovery; test-legacy "
"explicitly runs nonproduction OS tests; test-smoke checks BIOS/UEFI boot of all three media types "
"sequentially. test-build includes Pages documentation regressions and needs Sphinx on the host; "
"ordinary kernel and userspace compilation do not thereby depend on it. Choose targeted checks "
"according to risk; passing steps before a known failure is not a full-suite pass."

msgid ""
"APK 归属测试和组件 Kconfig 维护脚本支持 Python 3.10+；3.10 另需 TOML 解析包 ``tomli``（Debian/Ubuntu 的 "
"``python3-tomli``），3.11+ 使用标准库 ``tomllib``。APK 夹具在测试子进程中固定 ``umask 022``，避免继承宿主 私有权限掩码后与预期文件模式冲突。 "
"宿主文件写入失败测试使用子进程的文件大小限制，验证短写后报错、原文件 保留与临时文件清理；不依赖 root 是否能绕过目录权限。"
msgstr ""
"APK ownership tests and component Kconfig maintenance scripts support Python 3.10+. Python 3.10 "
"also needs TOML parser ``tomli`` (``python3-tomli`` on Debian/Ubuntu); 3.11+ uses standard-library"
" ``tomllib``. APK fixtures set ``umask 022`` in test subprocesses to avoid inheriting private host"
" masks that conflict with expected modes. Host file-write failure tests use subprocess file-size "
"limits to verify errors after short writes, original-file preservation, and temporary-file "
"cleanup; they do not depend on whether root bypasses directory permissions."

msgid ""
"``make test-audio`` 仍需要真实 ALSA 和 OPL3 构建依赖； ``tools/test_audio_userland.py`` 的日志写入 ``out/audio-"
"hda/qa/logs/``。 音频产品检查需要已有内核包、rootfs 和 SDK，缺少产物必须报错。"
msgstr ""
"``make test-audio`` still requires real ALSA and OPL3 build dependencies; "
"``tools/test_audio_userland.py`` writes logs to ``out/audio-hda/qa/logs/``. Audio product checks "
"require existing kernel packages, rootfs, and SDK; missing artifacts must be errors."

msgid "仓库边界"
msgstr "Repository boundaries"

msgid ""
"ReliefOS 持有应用、运行库、SDK、APK、安装器、镜像与完整系统 QEMU/VMware 集成测试。内核实现、驱动、文件系统、调度、内存和 Linux UAPI 的测试及原生 "
"系统调用探针由 ReliefNT 仓库持有，入口见其 ``Documentation/process/testing.rst``。混合套件按实现归属拆开，主仓不保留 内核夹具副本或旧脚本转发文件。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefOS owns applications, runtime libraries, SDK, APKs, installer, images, and full-system "
"QEMU/VMware integration tests. ReliefNT owns tests and native syscall probes for kernel "
"implementation, drivers, filesystems, scheduling, memory, and Linux UAPI; see its "
"``Documentation/process/testing.rst``. Mixed suites are split by implementation ownership; this "
"repository keeps neither copies of kernel fixtures nor old script-forwarding files."

msgid ""
"``tests/build/test-test-ownership.sh`` 构建契约检查测试源码归属，包括 Shell 测试 直接引用内核私有源码和头文件的情况。旧内核桌面实现与可执行文件 "
"GID 服务权限的 残留检查由 ReliefNT 的 ``service_roles`` 套件持有；主仓的 ``tests/build/test-x11-only.sh`` "
"只检查本仓的应用、运行库与产品配置。 主仓保留方便调用的 ``test-vdso``、``test-smp-time``、``test-page-cache-growth``、 ``test-"
"user-return``、``test-syscall-io``、``test-kernel-host`` 与 ``test-kernel-ownership`` Make "
"目标，它们委托内核自己的 Make 入口， 不在父仓复制内核测试清单。``test-legacy`` 同样先委托内核定向回归组， 再运行主仓 Unix IPC 与用户态 syscall 头检查。"
msgstr ""
"The ``tests/build/test-test-ownership.sh`` build contract checks test-source ownership, including "
"shell tests directly referencing private kernel sources/headers. ReliefNT's ``service_roles`` "
"suite owns residual checks for old kernel desktop implementations and executable GID service "
"permissions; this repository's ``tests/build/test-x11-only.sh`` checks only its applications, "
"runtime, and product configuration. Convenient Make targets ``test-vdso``, ``test-smp-time``, "
"``test-page-cache-growth``, ``test-user-return``, ``test-syscall-io``, ``test-kernel-host``, and "
"``test-kernel-ownership`` remain here, delegating to kernel-owned Make entry points without "
"copying the kernel test list. ``test-legacy`` likewise delegates targeted kernel regression groups"
" first, then runs this repository's Unix IPC and userspace syscall-header checks."

msgid ""
"来宾启动、SDK 编译和应用互操作仍由本仓编排；需要原生 ABI 探针时，直接消费 ``kernel/reliefnt/tools/tests/`` 内的源文件；公开 UAPI 的消费和完整系统的"
" 构建集成检查仍属于主仓。"
msgstr ""
"This repository still orchestrates guest boot, SDK compilation, and application interoperability. "
"When native ABI probes are needed, consume sources directly from ``kernel/reliefnt/tools/tests/``."
" Public-UAPI consumption and full-system build-integration checks also remain here."

msgid "运行证据"
msgstr "Runtime evidence"

msgid ""
"QEMU 测试使用私有磁盘，保留源镜像与注入载荷摘要、完整串口、返回码、 截图和独立读回。界面出现不等于交互成功；编译成功不等于镜像含有新文件。 Installer 还须覆盖安装后的无 ISO "
"启动；VT、权限、错误路径分别检查。 QEMU 的 VMware 显卡型号不能替代 VMware 真实运行证明。 现有失败见 :doc:`../admin-"
"guide/limitations`；不重生成 golden 掩盖差异。"
msgstr ""
"QEMU tests use private disks and preserve source-image and injected-payload digests, complete "
"serial logs, return codes, screenshots, and independent readback. A visible UI does not prove "
"successful interaction; successful compilation does not prove new files reached the image. "
"Installer tests must also boot the installed system without an ISO, checking VT, permissions, and "
"error paths separately. QEMU's VMware graphics model cannot replace real VMware evidence. Existing"
" failures are in :doc:`../admin-guide/limitations`; do not regenerate golden data to hide "
"differences."

msgid "Xorg 渲染回归"
msgstr "Xorg rendering regressions"

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/xorg_render_runtime_probe.c`` 是在隔离 X server 上运行的维护 探针，不安装到产品镜像。它使用 POSIX C 和 "
"Xlib。可在具备 C 编译器、X11 开发头及库的 ReliefOS 来宾内编译并运行::"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/xorg_render_runtime_probe.c`` is a maintenance probe for an isolated X server, not "
"installed in product images. It uses POSIX C and Xlib and can be compiled and run in a ReliefOS "
"guest with a C compiler and X11 development headers/libraries::"

msgid ""
"``--wait`` 只验证可连接 X server；``--wait-wm`` 等待窗口管理器发布 ``_NET_SUPPORTING_WM_CHECK`` "
"并检查目标窗口回指自身，拒绝失效属性；两者都 不能替代绘制测试。普通模式检查同步 矩形绘制、批量绘制、重叠滚动、窗口移动和 Pixmap 创建/复制/销毁；关键 阶段以 XGetImage "
"验证像素。X 错误、错误像素和分配失败均使探针失败。 独立 heartbeat 进程每两秒输出时间，供外部超时监视器检查系统是否仍响应。"
msgstr ""
"``--wait`` checks only X-server connectivity. ``--wait-wm`` waits for ``_NET_SUPPORTING_WM_CHECK``"
" and checks that the target window points back to itself, rejecting stale properties. Neither "
"replaces rendering tests. Normal mode checks synchronous and batched rectangle drawing, "
"overlapping scrolling, window movement, and Pixmap creation/copy/destruction; XGetImage verifies "
"pixels at key stages. X errors, wrong pixels, or allocation failures fail the probe. An "
"independent heartbeat process prints time every two seconds so an external timeout monitor can "
"check system responsiveness."

msgid ""
"探针的窗口使用 override_redirect，窗口移动不等于验证 IceWM 鼠标拖动。 普通模式要求窗口无遮挡；XGetImage 不保证返回被遮挡且无 backing store 的 "
"窗口区域内容，见 `Xlib 图像读回约定 <https://www.x.org/releases/X11R7.6/doc/libX11/specs/libX11/libX11.html>`_。 "
"与其他桌面应用并发时，使用 ``--offscreen`` 在独占 Pixmap 上 绘制和校验，并复制首尾画面到窗口，避免把遮挡/Expose 当作绘制错误。 同步绘制包含 X11 "
"往返开销；批量绘制包含末尾读回，不能将它们解释为纯 GPU 吞吐量。计时只用于诊断，返回零也不表示达到了某个性能门槛。"
msgstr ""
"Probe windows use override_redirect; moving them does not validate IceWM mouse dragging. Normal "
"mode requires unobscured windows: XGetImage does not guarantee contents of obscured regions "
"without backing store; see `Xlib image readback contract "
"<https://www.x.org/releases/X11R7.6/doc/libX11/specs/libX11/libX11.html>`_. Alongside other "
"desktop applications, use ``--offscreen`` to draw and validate in an exclusive Pixmap, copying "
"initial/final frames to the window so obscuration/Expose is not mistaken for drawing errors. "
"Synchronous drawing includes X11 round trips; batched drawing includes final readback, so neither "
"measures pure GPU throughput. Timing is diagnostic only; zero exit status does not imply a "
"performance threshold was met."

msgid ""
"比较性能时使用相同探针、桌面配置、分辨率、vCPU 和内存，等待 IceWM 就绪后重复采样，顺序运行各台 VM。软件对照使用 modesetting 的 ``AccelMethod "
"none``，加速对照使用 ``AccelMethod glamor``；从 Xorg 日志 分别确认 ``glamor disabled`` 和 ``glamor X acceleration "
"enabled on SVGA3D``， 并记录 VMware host renderer。记录内核和探针摘要、完整串口、返回码与每轮 耗时；不能把启动期间加载字体/库的耗时直接当作稳定渲染性能。"
msgstr ""
"For performance comparisons use the same probe, desktop configuration, resolution, vCPUs, and "
"memory; sample repeatedly after IceWM is ready and run VMs sequentially. Use modesetting "
"``AccelMethod none`` for software and ``AccelMethod glamor`` for acceleration. Confirm ``glamor "
"disabled`` and ``glamor X acceleration enabled on SVGA3D`` respectively in Xorg logs and record "
"the VMware host renderer. Record kernel/probe digests, full serial logs, return codes, and per-run"
" times. Font/library loading during startup is not steady-state rendering performance."

msgid ""
"全量 syscall-trace 会向串口输出大量日志，显著扰动测试，应仅用于定性 定位；其结果不能进入性能对照。超时、探针失败、Xorg 退出和 Kernel Panic "
"要分别记录。稳定性测试应另行叠加桌面应用、CPU/内存压力与重复启动， 并保留 panic 的 Reason、RIP 和调用栈；短时无崩溃不构成永久稳定性保证。"
msgstr ""
"Full syscall-trace produces heavy serial logging and significantly perturbs tests; use it only for"
" qualitative diagnosis, never performance comparisons. Record timeouts, probe failures, Xorg "
"exits, and Kernel Panics separately. Stability tests should additionally combine desktop "
"applications, CPU/memory pressure, and repeated boots, retaining panic Reason, RIP, and call "
"stacks. A short crash-free period is no guarantee of permanent stability."
